#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:4445
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje greški"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Before filing a bug report, please read our <ulink url=\"https://sourceforge."
"net/p/smb4k/wiki/Home/\">wiki</ulink>. Many common problems are already "
"covered there. Also, try the <ulink url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/"
"smb4k/files/\">latest version</ulink> of &smb4k;. Maybe your problem has "
"already been fixed."
msgstr ""
"Prije podnošenja izvještaja greške, molimo vas pročitajte našu stanicu "
"<ulink url=\"https://sourceforge.net/p/smb4k/wiki/Home/\">wiki</ulink>. "
"Mnogi zajednički problemi već su opisani tamo.Također, pokušajte otići na "
"stranicu <ulink url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/smb4k/files/\">zadnju "
"verziju</ulink> &smb4k;.Možda je vaš problem več riješen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4448
#, no-c-format
msgid "Follow these directions for your bug report:"
msgstr "Slijedite ove smjernice za vašu prijavu greške:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Describe <emphasis>in detail</emphasis> what you did to receive the problem "
"you are reporting."
msgstr ""
"Opišite <emphasis> u detalje </emphasis> šta ste uradili pa imate problem "
"koji prijavljujete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4451
#, no-c-format
msgid "Provide the version of &smb4k; and &kde;."
msgstr "Osigurava verziju &smb4k; i &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mention your operating system (&Linux;, FreeBSD, &etc;) and the distribution "
"that is running on your computer."
msgstr ""
"Spomenite vaš operativni sistem (&Linux;, FreeBSD, &etc;) i distribuciju "
"koji se izvodi na vašem računalu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include the full error message if an error dialog was displayed."
msgstr "Ukoliko je prikazan dijalog greške, prikazuje se čitava poruka greške."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4454
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you experienced a crash, attach a full backtrace. For this it is "
"recommended that you (re-)compile &smb4k; with debugging symbols. How this "
"is done is mentioned in the <link linkend=\"appendix_compilation"
"\">Configuration, Compilation and Installation</link> appendix."
msgstr ""
"Ako dođe do greške ili slično i želite da ispravite izvorni kod sami , "
"pokrenite ga sa ispravljenim simpolima. Postupak je sličan onome koji je "
"opisan u <link linkend=\"appendix_compilation\"> Sastavljanje i instalacija "
"</link> odjeljku osim što vam je potrebno da malo modificirati naredbu cmake:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4455
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add additional data, &eg; send a screen shot if you are reporting a &GUI; "
"related problem."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj dodatne podatke, &ie;;priložite povratnu tačku ukoliko se desi neka "
"greška, pošaljite nam sliku ekrana ukoliko prijavljute &GUI;  problem,&etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:4457
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The recommended method to report a bug is to go to our <ulink url="
#| "\"https://sourceforge.net/p/smb4k/tickets/\">bug tracking system</ulink> "
#| "and fill out the form. But you can also use the dialog that opens when "
#| "you click the <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report "
#| "Bug...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgid ""
"The recommended method to report a bug is to go to the <ulink url=\"https://"
"bugs.kde.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=Smb4k&amp;format=guided\">KDE Bugtracking "
"System</ulink> and fill out the form. But you can also use the dialog that "
"opens when you click the <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Preporučena metoda da prijavite bug je da se ode na  našu stanicu <ulink url="
"\"https://sourceforge.net/p/smb4k/tickets/\">bug tracking system</ulink> i "
"popuni obrazac.Ali možete također koristit dijalog koji se otvara kada "
"kliknete na <menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prijavu "
"grešku...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu stavku."

